.idea
.venv
.env
.env.local
.skrubify.env

**/input/**
*.png
__pycache__/

*.csv
*.svg
*.json
*.tsv
*.parquet
*.tfevents
# runtime stats collected by pipeline_analyzer.runtime: a project artifact that
# belongs next to the report it feeds, unlike the raw data the *.json rule targets
!**/runtime_stats_*.json
# ... but not its full memory series (one csv per pipeline, can be large); the
# store itself keeps a downsampled curve
**/runtime_stats_*.mem/
# each run's state dump IS the trajectory - the tooling reads it, so it is tracked
# like the pipelines beside it, not ignored as raw data
!**/journal_slim.json
!**/final_state.json
# how a sample was built IS the record of that sample: the data under
# sample/input/ is ignored by the input/ rule above, but the recipe's own output
# - sizes, knobs, seed, row counts before and after - is the only thing left
# that says what the numbers were measured on
!**/sample_manifest.json
!**/cloud_manifest.json
!**/benchmark_v1/manifest.json

# stratum bufferpool evictions
.stratum

# download caches next to a dataset: the BEAVER dump, and Kaggle competition
# files that get_data.sh splits into input/
*/raw/
